e_Shop\" title=\"Magma Cave Shop\">Magma Cave Store</a> located in the <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Caves\" title=\"Magma Caves\">Magma Caves</a> for $15,000 . The fire potion allows the user to gain immunity from heat and fire, but not from lava.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>The Fire Potion looks as the name suggests. It is a glass potion bottle in the shape of a flame design, with a cork inserted into the bottle. The cork has a fire ornament attached to its top. The liquid inside has the glow and appearance of magma found in Oaklands.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163219\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 58/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 64/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019473/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.716      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   29.716      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2509-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163219 and revision id 11453. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Magma Cave Shop","exists":true},{"title":"Magma Caves","exists":true}],"images":["Fire_Potion.png"]}
